d.B('**The density scan:**',"""**Chains verified (v1.2 gate):** re-run for this Finalise on the SBLGNT index, with a positive control first (κατοικέω at 1:19 and 2:9):
- μερίς + κλῆρος: Acts 8:21 and Col 1:12 only;
- ἡ ἐξουσία τοῦ σκότους, by ordered phrase: Luke 22:53 and Col 1:13 only;
- μυστήριον + φανερόω within two verses: Col 1:26–27, Col 4:3–4 and 1 Tim 3:16 only;
- ἐν χάριτι, by ordered phrase: seven verses, including 3:16 and 4:6;
- δεῖ, by form: 4:4 and 4:6 only;
- λόγος: seven verses of the letter, none in 3:8–9;
- θέλημα: 1:1, 1:9, 4:12, so not in 1:24–2:5;
- δοῦλος: 3:11, 3:22, 4:1, 4:12, so not at 4:9;
- τέλειος and ἀγωνίζομαι: 1:28 and 1:29 respectively, each with 4:12;
- ἐνοικέω: Rom 8:11; 2 Cor 6:16; Col 3:16; 2 Tim 1:5, 14;
- ἀποκαταλλάσσω: Col 1:20, 22; Eph 2:16;
- κατενώπιον: Eph 1:4; Col 1:22; Jude 24;
- εἴ γε: five verses;
- first-person plurals in the letter: inclusive only at 1:13–14 and 2:13–14, as audit 5 reports.

In Swete, read directly: Ps 67:17; Exod 6:6, 8; Exod 10:23; Deut 9:26, 29; 10:9; Isa 42:7, 16; Ps 106:6, 10, 14, 20; Wis 18:1. **Two shape claims failed this gate** and are corrected above (Echo 64; Luke 1:79). Audit 5's baselines are accepted as settled, not re-run.

""")
